Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally serious! Just hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time, Mista,\Nno one gives a shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, listen, this is a\Ngood one, I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, let me ask you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think human flesh would taste\Nlike crap, or would it actually rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe not\Nruin all our appetites?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell goes on in that\Nmessed up head of yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go sit at the dipshit table!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna stay right where\Nyou are it's the press you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,must pay the truth you'll never\Ncome to experience it's mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, sa, same ni wa me\Nwo Laghi ni mono ni wa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem wo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può sfuggire dal\Ndestino scelto, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,solo il risultato Che voi sarete distrutti
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we go too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear of the fear is going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,in the world I don't need to be in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,world I don't need to be in the body I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't need to be in the heart. Hell no,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The beginning of the day wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he manage to get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucket amateurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you failed to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Unsurprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, something troubles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My premonition clearly showed that\NI would be the one to prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What twisted powers did Requiem give him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get my hands on you, you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But first things first, I must\Nbreak free from this damn current!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My luck is turning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Katsone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you touch my goat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll serve you like a doughy slice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you think I won't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well think again, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show your dumb ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll poke you full of holes,\Nyou weird strawberry with legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my code!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my code!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be how I died!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Diavolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A common huddle could\Npossibly be my undoing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,THAT DOESN'T MAKE ANY SENSE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I get on this table?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment ago, I barely\Nmanaged to escape the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Procedural date is the 25th, time 1120 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,File number 68, acting physician, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Monica Ultello here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The deceased looks to be an\Nadult male, 30 to 40 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Identity is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Condition of his skin suggests time\Nof death was 48 to 50 hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing autopsy to\Nfind out cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't play your sick game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The body was discovered in\Nclose proximity to the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand you explain\Nyourself now! Hey! Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell'd you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What foul curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that thing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I just letting this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain, it's unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause of death is a laceration to\Nthe liver, likely caused by a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The lack of hesitation wounds\Nmeans this was not suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open up his abdomen\Nand check, just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,His liver's in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The color's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it all just a horrible nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't where I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I recall, I'd been\Nthrown into the Diver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there was that terrible pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still feel the cold steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was far too real to\Nbe a damnable dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But how am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay there, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need medical attention,\NI can call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I meet such an undignified end?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you wrought on\Nme, Golden Wind Requiem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pick up traces of Azora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still lurking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't rest until we find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, take a breath now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to look for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't ever be back, even\Nthough I couldn't witness
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,requiem at work myself something\Ndeep in my soul tells me our
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,job is done nothing will ever\Ncome within his putrid reach
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,again not even the truth of his\Nultimate fate will grace him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,his own death will remain a\Nmystery to him for all eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sitting funny,\Nmister. Does your tummy hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But we didn't finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His end is without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Golden Wind Requiem's judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How many deaths must I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll happen to me next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer do I\Nhave to wait for the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's over then, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We really won?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get back to the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Butrati's soul is gonna need\Nits old body patched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just know the man's gonna lose his\Nshit if he wakes up to all of us gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a word I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's heal Bucciarati\Nand head the hell home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah, you've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What we've finally accomplished is\Nnothing short of a full and true victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate is but a slumbering slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One that we have at last\Nemancipated! The day is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,open your minds fellas I'm telling you\Nit's important to think about what it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,is you're eating because that shit is\Ndirectly connected to your happiness you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know how it\Nsounds, but I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, think of all the\Nanimals that are carnivores.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, like the lions,\Nthe cats, and the vultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't find those meat-eating critters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in a restaurant menu for one\Nobvious reason. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because those nastiest\Nsuckers freakin' reek!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They taste like duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat flesh is super nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You with me so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,News flash, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us knows what a cat tastes like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,because we would never\Neven think to eat one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the sweet fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys never touch insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They only eat fresh algae.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Some say that's the reason why their\Ninnards taste a million times better than
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,all the other fish who only snack on\Ndisgusting shit like worms and crickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their meat-free diets. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's logical to conclude,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,those sweet animals who\Ndon't eat meat are actually
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones who produce the\Nbest-tasting meat of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cows, pigs, chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The healthier their diets, the\Ntastier our dinners, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple math!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Which also means us meat-eating\Nhumans tastes like ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bullet-proof logic! That may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly coherent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of stories\Nabout how humans taste good,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but we've figured out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then what does that say about all of the\Nfruits and vegetables that I usually eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should throw you\Non the grill and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, God, you are\Nsuch an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice of you to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A man at the airport, a\Ncertain leaky-eyed Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told someone's\Ndiscovered his cold body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct orders from Capo Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gives a shit about Luca?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that asshole had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he deserves for picking on\Nthe weak and pushing drugs onto kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's there to investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumbass probably got\Nhigh and hit his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,your passionate feelings do not excuse\Nyou from choosing your words with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't be too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you worry, I won't half-ass it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Future capos like you\Nshouldn't do grunt work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll look into this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy's been waiting for you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims to be a humble flower\Nshop owner from the piazza.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've checked the man's story out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an ordinary, hard-working man who lost\Nhis only daughter about six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, as you can plainly see,\Nmy legs aren't what they once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But in spite of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've traveled all the way here on my\Nown today, hoping that I might meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So please forgive me if I\Nappear shaky at the knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My good man, do you pay all your taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I... pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a very simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you pay what you owe your country?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Every lira of it on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fully and never late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I would strongly advise you\Nto take your business elsewhere, good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no place for\Nsomeone such as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal and honest taxpaying citizen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,one might say, should perhaps avail\Nhimself of his local police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For as soon as I hear the\Nfirst word of your request,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you will gain a new debt greater than anyone\Nyou've known to me and my dear familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like every other father, I work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I toil long hours to afford\Nfood, and I try my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,as any father would do, to raise\Nhis children with love and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She was my only girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this past September\Nthat she turned 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me for asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would much prefer it if we could\Ncontinue our conversation in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,While I am sympathetic to your plight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the men in this room place their absolute\Ntrust in me, and I place mine in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:16:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So unfortunately, I can't just ask them to\Nsimply interrupt their meal for our sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be plain rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It all happened suddenly a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned from my wife that our daughter\Nhad gone and found herself a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me the young man was a\Nsculptor just beginning on his way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but that didn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even mind that he\Nwas a bit older than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet never, not once, did he\Ncome to meet me and my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That never sat quite right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my precious flower fell from the\Nroof of that man's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,clutching to her chest some strange rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost my composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the pain still feel\Nso fresh after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter was my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:16:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She was young and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She lit up my world with\Nher astounding radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to do everything that\Nyou can to see that my girl is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,avenged please make that rotten\Nscoundrel suffer for what he did
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,stop for a moment you\Nthink she was killed am
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,i hearing you correctly\Nand you believe this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,boyfriend was the killer\Nthat he was the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,pushed her off of the roof\Ni must say i find this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,quite strange news of murder in this town
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,always reaches me the\Npolice refused to start an
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,investigation they wrote\Nit off as suicide and swept
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The case aside like my\Nlawyer, but as Sir Familia,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we can swear to you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our beautiful girl would\Nnever have taken her own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Both my wife and I know this\Nto be true in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody else left I\Ncan turn to at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you to make that bastard\Nfeel just a fraction of my pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him have a small taste of what I will
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,endure for the remainder\Nof my wretched life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this world has been\Ncruel to you, but I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my condolences\Nare all I can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mistake us for a band\Nof lowly ruffians who would
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,kill anyone for money But\NI've seen the things you've
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,done for the people in town\NAll I'm really asking for is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,justice for my departed daughter\NYou say you want justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Signore,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,not long ago you wished to speak\Ntogether in private And I've figured
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,out why It seems you are perfectly\Naware of how dangerous your inquiry is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'll admit your devotion to\Nyour familia struck a chord with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of my soft spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I also think it's rather suspicious\Nthat no one else has been moved by your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,story This might just be worth looking\Ninto after all I suppose at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll see what this mysterious\Nsculptor has to say I will
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,ask for your payment only\Nafter he has been found guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless your soul, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, I would like to\Ntake you on this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lay this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, be sure to put that\Nback where you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,did I knock it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where this\Nstone was perched earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I swear it's almost\Nlike it popped out of the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch yourself\Nwhen you're standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer my things not\Nin pieces on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, Bucciarati says he'll\Ngive you a ride part of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,take this i've written down the sculptor's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,home address and here's\Na picture of our man
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,have a little chat with him see\Nwhat you can find out you're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,free to employ physical coercion\Nif you need to get a clear
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,confession you have your\Nrecorder yeah but just so i know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How far is too far? Like if it\Nturns out he did push that poor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,girl off a roof how many\Nbullets am I supposed to use
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,remember we're not assassins\Nlet's just put him in a wheelchair
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,for the rest of the decade the\Npolice can take it from there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that should be more than enough\Nto cool the old man's rage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,hey where you off to will you stop\Nmessing around we'll leave you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what's the damn\Nholdup? Need a shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing something important, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You look troubled. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something about\Nthat old man's story
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,that's rubbing me wrong all\Nsorts of ways right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when his daughter fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm remembering right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he mentioned something about her\Nclutching a weird stone of some sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say exactly what\Nkind of stone it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he said nothing about its shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even how big it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the freaking dude is\Na sculptor, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All he said was it looked strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I could name a ton of different\Nthings that look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it was the\Nonly adjective he gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pull over for a\Nsec, Fugo! Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Slam the brakes, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, I told you to go before we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how much wine\Ndid you have to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is that always\Nthe first place you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not drunk, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a little loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Think before you speak, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Words can hurt, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that it over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what a drama queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure he really wants a friend right\Nnow, but maybe I should just go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.31,0:22:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can watch Mista's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.44,0:22:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to err on the side of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rumors of stand users convening\Non our city has me on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go look into Leaky Eye Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the guy lives on the seventh floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And right above it is the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice place, Skolipi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spot where the old man\Nsaid his daughter hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wasn't seeing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This just got a whole\Nlot more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.62,0:23:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna figure out your damn deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Butrati...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.78,0:23:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
